{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase funding for staff in hospitals to support those in mental health crisis",
        "additional_details": "Hospitals are places where sick and vulnerable people are meant to be looked after. I think the government need to increase funding so these places are safer for us.",
        "background": "Increase funding for more staff to ensure vulnerable patients cannot hurt themselves. When anybody, whatever age, is admitted to a general or psychiatric hospital, whether this be A&E or detained under the Mental Health Act, they must be kept safe.",
